  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ebff2ad606cf73dec3f23384",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "旋转一圈之后哇喔！第一名的姿势！",
      "source_fingerprint": "14ede58bc70da0754f73d39d465f7c043d0d41d46548047fd08c0f3abf9289b4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "30207"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c79772af07b2a48129df8e35",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要开始比赛咯——！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "16b439216ca3322b735d3365cf6ee04840ec9c562f548124dce7c5cdc7a7a874",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "31000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0bb3af10439588cabb368773",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "变得有趣起来了！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "70c9b705e67ff2ea91c0d96cda2141d0d55991e49023ce924325f2f7257c97e5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "40000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:564ccb63cccdb8585b0a1578",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "钓鱼讲究意志力，是一场与自己的\r\n战斗……钓起狡诈的泳池之王时，\r\n我的心必定会战胜氯气的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cdc71f1d4432310762e2d73fe3d6a420385e167395d38744c995cb2d63a289c3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "400001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8d79c2e512c0744e7c196f99",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "糟糕，外出旅行时得把养在房内的\r\n图画纸带去请别人照顾才行～！\r\n我不在身边它应该很寂寞吧……",
      "source_fingerprint": "78aadf5619bb7a09dda085edd427dda691582fffdb6ec0d3608a2f99da21e5c5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "400004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2224cf4981a0bfbb1836bc13",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "跟你讲，鲑鱼其实是白肉鱼喔。\r\n而这场对决也将藉由黑白分明的\r\n胜负，决定在生物学上的分类！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7e0fba5311114ddd53e529af1b83420de539bc45bbc9ae16402ab4f695d587bb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "400007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a855059c77e904f84917243d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "变得有趣起来了！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "70c9b705e67ff2ea91c0d96cda2141d0d55991e49023ce924325f2f7257c97e5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "40001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ae6dc5ee695819571b4a5002",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "等你全部完成之后\r\n我就借给你半个世界哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "08b14a1330aff9575707fa9db2bfc2af36e0c3e7f1f08f6410a38d990cc461f5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "400012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b598e18c83bdf79dc217c223",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "抱歉，活动\r\n已经结束啦。\r\n等下次庆典吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5934b54003377d72d49874005fd04e2b8f7f26029a6329bd1f2e74ad24ea87f6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "400013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d33703eca5586572b197df7c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哈啊！吃我一招啊！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0b0041d6a54072875b589b78cb3fcaa98a3f80e4a2448d25522ba57389dc2fd5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "40002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4464539997f1917ceb37b1ef",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我不会把竹轮让给任何人的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2d9173fca7c698b87e8bd8572013061b8e84830b79aef8ca25ccdd086a52987b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "40003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2b331e6423bd0f1f22dbc99b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "震撼全阿船的海底世界大冒险！\r\n是礼赞还是反叛？是罪还是罚？\r\n鰤鱼还是幼鰤鱼……Coming soon！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c58e2611320f472dbab404c2f03bd26f1564119a285c5332274489942f3c9dce",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "40004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9021a1a3ae55440be86c95c6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这就是我的法式全餐啊啊啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7b5cca4a6ecc88a5a0cd3c23423310602f215d3ae9cb0ed8d9c037c7d91a1c30",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "40203"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e3425f26aa169bc53ee68cc2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无数阿船沈眠于这片土地。\r\n当鱿鱼脚的香味弥漫时，花都将会\r\n遍布摊贩！传说就此展开～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "97e337be6fd35f059b4a47c633a74f4a52f2fbe6c0d4cf7fd8138987eeec58b6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "40204"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3969d1a072bb1a0490a94c52",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要上咯！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6307a6156580df446ec661f6a7bc561dd26e7fe9066389a88113d3afa0269729",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "410000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cffeaf86a8e13e1175db2532",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好耶ーー！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0ec8915668058484684b6bfc7590323e8de49e0e43831fc62e4215c95d188b67",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "410001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cac8a6dcb7dd1af2e42a0fde",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "妙啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e2c58d33d404fe94edfa2a590789e03965de965a93efce11f58f2f041ec7d034",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
