    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:49a01f23146928ce5e56f85f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "全部俘虏吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3306041dd3d219700c9195de38850346a09ab72ca70783c6a0a8957eeb6e3ae9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "60000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4c64c487da7a7257f6f80794",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "爱之力全开☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "13adfa7b1597d807b518ad33ee2157db836420676ec30fb6e81c21df81d6f2c4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "60001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c321af81da8db35bc305bb1e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嘛，那准备出发吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "25be5eb46181223d84670a7a529ccfed9f8ea9eb3c8aeb322ccfd44f8b84ca1d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "70000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4357b56cd211c719b421a3e6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我在想啊，怎么会有你这么闲的人\n………那和我相遇以后\n你的人生，变得有趣起来了吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "b8172e56f26b8dd1cc06aad633b87830be4db13ea84a3fd8156cc5e49f537a95",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "70001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1e981fd93f0037773a3c6b03",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "优等生小金船换装♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "7cad02f5713d0d11b4f17129206ecfbff338ced93c8bcab424f9617a6717c332",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "70004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:01d0fe8958ef24d256db3123",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不妙啊…连这么可爱的服装\n也很适合…我真可怕。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bcca8af7a39b81a3ff7d46096f6c8a9f0a51108f0a25100f9b3371b1729f9303",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "70008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b368df03e89dd733e6ebb068",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "现在的小金船没有不可能！\n制作吧，高达100米的纸牌塔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ac76e5f0712b02a7fba7fad0318611e39f046b4df222b18537b2f51e93ff2ef3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "70009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d7e0d46fb35b25de93c1e3f7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这身制服里藏着间谍道具哦\n骗你的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b0530f0ab1f0a1057876f0da695b91057da0d83fec2268c84cdb336ac5435721",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "70010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:99e86d1aae5f07486ac9b17e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "知道这闪亮亮的原材料吗？…不，\n什么都不能说，这也是为了你。",
      "source_fingerprint": "56e48fd36db1ac298ad8658a2914d74fc2c113d422e1069879f82da573557d10",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "70014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7cb01a907370f0f78a0d08c2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如果触碰了这位赤红的\n金船大人的话，会遭天谴的哦…",
      "source_fingerprint": "08d8eb650bb6284e818dd79904624f3763256351b8ebb85c80746bcede526ea4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "70015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5f3f940de03b0d00c976a341",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呀哈哈☆\r\n来抓我啊～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7586c97d081ce58ab0150d3cd9ced34162bbba8ef21234aa1e8d218e71921d5b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "70016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:343da9603d5bc26166551f49",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哦？看入迷啦？\r\n是不是看我看到入迷啦～？",
      "source_fingerprint": "be12b18378412d9c8d005e16b12b59e8ddb4fde910d2327f7a3fd72833b8761f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "70017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:451109a70123d258bf7b7add",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "胜利之舞～～～～！！！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7a066936dc499e4bf428f6062ce8ed144bb54e27254f140d7a777bab9047c9b2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "70018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b5fd9d416d31af2d5f24a120",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "来一场激烈又有趣的对决吧～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "993739e928fc7fa71c2de2367b2947403bf332c9feb84912c9e9b59bbeb95fd3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "70019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f1df784c1aa5e1055a4ba74d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哦，休假了吗？你休假了对吧！？\r\n赞啦，我们走吧！\r\n到尚蒂伊的森林去！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a1c4e31ba777224173602aede0c8576e2d9204de87aa7a665c9680c470151921",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "70020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c7e75d70e114fe4fa3653cb5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这套衣服正是阿船家\r\n代代相传的传说装备……",
      "source_fingerprint": "e68286b59590bdde210d6120a87116b45adef6e14a9b81be67969b7c15704065",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "70021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a8c61d4874d303eaaff400a0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我的美貌是种罪，所以我要惩罚你。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a3d52a08701687d7923815f2a6a9ad87bcb00a33caccf3ccbca8b7c3a7c8ab63",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "70216"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:94b8635bf832ad9cba87dc01",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我背后的锚可以拿来装名片。很棒吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "74b7b42fe00b15b07bd7f56dd636e0c3440b7eecaf99e47d7dea75f37d5c77ba",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
